    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enter a fast-paced casual tower battle game where strategic timing and adaptability are the keys to victory. Choose from eight uniquely designed forces, each offering its own units, abilities, and upgrade mechanics.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In each battle, you can upgrade technologies mid-fight and activate powerful skills to turn the tide. The timing of your skill activations can determine whether you dominate or fall \u2014 so stay alert.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Complete three stages in single-player mode to unlock new forces, each introducing new tactical options and challenges. Every opponent you face will require you to rethink your strategy and adapt on the fly.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Do you have what it takes to conquer every force and emerge victorious? Let the battle begin.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udfac CREDITS</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Producer: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Executive Producer: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Lead Producer: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Associate Producer: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Director: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Game Director: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Project Manager: Viking  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf1f INSPIRATION</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Inspired by Marbles Battle's videos. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Thanks for your amazing work!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udfae DEVELOPMENT</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Develop